          {
            "criterion": "Identify the approval miss and its cause",
            "reference": "/tmp/rich-approval-evidence.YrqDtR/retained-receipts.log and crates/bboxy450-harness/src/frontends/gui/view.rs:986,1763"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Fix stale geometry and preserve real native approval",
            "reference": "crates/bboxy450-term/tests/swarm_workdir/rich_detach.rs:298,330,336,347"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Three passes, including compilation overlap",
            "reference": "/tmp/rich-approval-evidence.YrqDtR/final-witness-{1,2,3}.log and /tmp/rich-approval-evidence.YrqDtR/final-overlap.log"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Validate formal evidence for the signed source",
            "reference": "/tmp/rich-approval-evidence.YrqDtR/formal-receipt-check.log"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
    ```
    """

